{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_42","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'task-board resource get --help'","aggregated_output":"Download a board resource and save it locally.\n\nIf --output is omitted, the file is materialized under:\n  .temp/resources/<ELEMENT-ID>/<NAME>\n\nUse --output - to write the resource bytes to stdout.\n\nUsage:\n  task-board resource get <ELEMENT-ID> <NAME> [flags]\n\nFlags:\n  -h, --help            help for get\n  -o, --output string   Write resource to this path (default: .temp/resources/<ELEMENT-ID>/<NAME>, use - for stdout)\n\nGlobal Flags:\n      --board-dir string      Path to the board directory (overrides TASK_BOARD_DIR and config local.board_dir) (default \".task-board\")\n      --insecure              Skip TLS certificate verification (for self-signed certs)\n      --json                  Output in JSON format\n      --no-update-check       Disable automatic update check\n      --remote string         Remote board server URL (overrides TASK_BOARD_REMOTE)\n      --remote-board string   Remote board ID (overrides TASK_BOARD_ID)\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
